{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Lauren discovers financial discrepancies at her company, all signs point to her manipulative and morally bankrupt colleague, Vicki. But when Lauren confronts her, Vicki lashes out \u2014 threatening to seduce someone very close to Lauren in a calculated move to hurt her both professionally and personally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/extras/a0819a81006e8dfe16cbf4d90256508d.poster.avif?t=1771395753\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/extras/a0819a81006e8dfe16cbf4d90256508d.webm?t=1771395753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/extras/a0819a81006e8dfe16cbf4d90256508d.mp4?t=1771395753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite Lauren\u2019s attempts to warn him about Vicki\u2019s ulterior motives, he\u2019s drawn in by the older woman\u2019s charm and seductive tactics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Vicki\u2019s influence grows, Lauren must make increasingly bold choices to hold his attention and keep him out of Vicki\u2019s grasp. But every move she makes only pushes the limits of her own morality \u2014 and every time she gains ground, Vicki escalates her game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lauren now finds herself at a <strong>crossroads</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will she fight fire with fire, risking her values and dignity to protect what matters most? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/extras/5a8d7677b77f3cd0d8b58f12c14b627d.poster.avif?t=1771395753\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/extras/5a8d7677b77f3cd0d8b58f12c14b627d.webm?t=1771395753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/extras/5a8d7677b77f3cd0d8b58f12c14b627d.mp4?t=1771395753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Or will she step back and watch Vicki take control in a battle of lust, power, and seduction?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/extras/a56132f3e18561899ab53cb664c1ecca.poster.avif?t=1771395753\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/extras/a56132f3e18561899ab53cb664c1ecca.webm?t=1771395753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/extras/a56132f3e18561899ab53cb664c1ecca.mp4?t=1771395753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guide Lauren through her journey of desire, deception, and personal conflict.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a mature visual novel packed with high-quality animations, immersive choices, and branching storylines. Navigate themes of love, temptation, corruption, and NTR \u2014 all from a female protagonist\u2019s point of view. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is an interactive visual novel with high-quality renders and animations, choices that will affect the captivating story, and multiple endings. The game also features corruption, and NTR themes, experienced from the perspective of a female protagonist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is structured around daily choices, where Lauren must walk a fine line between being emotionally supportive and dangerously alluring. Missteps could cost her everything\u2026 or awaken something unexpected inside her.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2885520?t=1771395753","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/c674628eb12b2a521457c50442d5a3b77263785d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771395753","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/96ac5e6a8bdecf426c76c0ef25ad958b22f3b6b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771395753","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/96ac5e6a8bdecf426c76c0ef25ad958b22f3b6b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771395753","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The game includes sexual depictions, full nudity, and voyeurism. It is not suitable for individuals under 18 years of age.\r\nAll sex in the game is consensual and all characters are over 18 years old.\r\nThis game contains themes of corruption, netorare (NTR), and love from the perspective of a female protagonist.\r\n\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Lauren discovers financial discrepancies at her company, all signs point to her manipulative and morally bankrupt colleague, Vicki. But when Lauren confronts her, Vicki lashes out \u2014 threatening to seduce someone very close to Lauren in a calculated move to hurt her both professionally and personally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/extras/a0819a81006e8dfe16cbf4d90256508d.poster.avif?t=1771395753\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885520/extras/a0819a81006e8dfe16cbf4d90256508d.webm?t=1771395753\"